::SECTION_51_WIC_IMAGE_DECODING_AND_ICON_PIPELINES::
@FAULT_NODE [ERR-IMG-001] {
    DOMAIN          : "Windows Imaging Component (WIC) Decoding & ICO/PNG Pixel Format Conversion (IWICFormatConverter)"
    PHENOMENON      : "Inverted Red/Blue channels, pitch stride misalignment crashes on non-power-of-two widths, or unclosed file locks on source images"
    ROOT_CAUSE      : "Assuming `width * 4` row stride instead of 4-byte DWORD-aligned `((width * 32 + 31) / 32) * 4`, or passing `GUID_WICPixelFormat32bppRGBA` instead of Win32-native `GUID_WICPixelFormat32bppPBGRA`."
    INVARIANT_RULE  : "Convert all decoded frames through `IWICFormatConverter` to `GUID_WICPixelFormat32bppPBGRA`, compute DWORD-aligned row stride explicitly, and decode from an `IStream` or release `IWICBitmapDecoder` immediately after `CopyPixels()`."
}

::SECTION_52_SYSTEM_TRAY_AND_EXPLORER_RESTART_RECOVERY::
@FAULT_NODE [ERR-TRY-001] {
    DOMAIN          : "Win32 Notification Area Icons & Explorer.exe Crash Recovery (Shell_NotifyIconW)"
    PHENOMENON      : "System tray icon vanishing permanently after `explorer.exe` restarts, or `NIM_ADD` failing during early Windows logon"
    ROOT_CAUSE      : "Registering the tray icon once at startup without listening for the dynamic `RegisterWindowMessageW(L\"TaskbarCreated\")` broadcast."
    INVARIANT_RULE  : "Cache `UINT wmTaskbarCreated = RegisterWindowMessageW(L\"TaskbarCreated\")` at window creation, re-issue `Shell_NotifyIconW(NIM_ADD, &nid)` inside `WndProc` whenever `uMsg == wmTaskbarCreated`, and invoke `NIM_DELETE` on exit."
}

::SECTION_53_LOCAL_PORT_BINDING_AND_LOOPBACK_ISOLATION::
@FAULT_NODE [ERR-PRT-001] {
    DOMAIN          : "Localhost Micro-Server Port Binding & Loopback Security (PHP 8.5 Built-in Server / Winsock)"
    PHENOMENON      : "`WSAEADDRINUSE` (10048) startup collisions, Windows Defender Firewall UAC prompts, or unintended LAN exposure"
    ROOT_CAUSE      : "Binding local telemetry/UI servers to `0.0.0.0` (all interfaces) or hardcoding a single static port without fallback probing."
    INVARIANT_RULE  : "Bind local-only servers strictly to `127.0.0.1` (eliminating external exposure and firewall prompts), probe an explicit deterministic port range (`49152..49250`) on `WSAEADDRINUSE`, and persist the bound port to a runtime lockfile."
}

::MASTER_VERIFICATION_GATE::
@GATE_CHECK_F17 {
    53. PBGRA_STRIDE_ALIGN : Normalize WIC image pipelines to `GUID_WICPixelFormat32bppPBGRA` with DWORD-aligned stride calculations.
    54. TASKBAR_REHYDRATE  : Listen for `RegisterWindowMessageW(L\"TaskbarCreated\")` to restore system tray icons across Explorer restarts.
    55. LOOPBACK_PORT_LOCK : Bind local services strictly to `127.0.0.1` with deterministic port probing and runtime lockfile discovery.
}
